# BigMoeLLM ↔ ODS ↔ LEONES

**Profile:** experimental MoE runtime designed to exceed VRAM through mmap, host-memory pinning and direct NVMe streaming.

**LEONES status:** experimental P1 candidate; reproduction pending.

## Summary

BigMoeLLM is built around consumer GPUs that cannot hold all experts simultaneously. Host memory and storage act as additional tiers while selected experts are moved to the accelerator.

## ODS fit

It is relevant to the low-VRAM MoE strategy and should be evaluated against MoE-Infinity and other expert-streaming runtimes.

**Classification:** P1 experimental MoE candidate.